Patches applied to the pristine libnvme-1.16.2 tarball by ../unpack.sh.

They apply with `patch -p1` from inside src/, in filename order.  Each one
starts with a few lines of prose saying what it does and why, then the diff.

None so far: the library builds unchanged against the LikeOS C library
(<linux/types.h>, ENOKEY/EBADSLT, SIOCPROTOPRIVATE come from there) with
the answers in ../config.h.

